data: {"id": "31cb3d50cf42422c-thinking-parallel_evidence-802", "run_id": "31cb3d50cf42422c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n- **Pod 身份与状态**：`aiops-case-v02/workload`，UID `49f4b3a0-...`，状态 **Pending**，`node: <none>`。\n- **Prometheus metrics**：`kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1`，其余 phase 为 0，无 restart/terminated_reason 样本，确认仍处于 Pending。\n- **日志/Trace 覆盖**：Logging (ES/Filebeat) 和 Tracing (DeepFlow/Tempo) 均返回 `empty/absent`；DeepFlow 因 `pod_ip is empty` 无法执行。对 Pending Pod 而言，这属于**预期行为**，不构成额外缺口。\n- **调度事件（根因证据）**：`kubectl describe` 和 `kubectl events` 均显示：\n  - `Warning FailedScheduling`\n  - 原文：**`0/3 nodes", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789110274915, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

